  "body": "## What changed\n\n- Added `OpType::Engrave` to `do_not_touch_applies` in `crates/app/src/operation/types/avoid.rs` so the Boundaries panel shows \"Pick protected\" for Engrave operations.\n- Added `crates/motion/src/machining2d/trace_avoid.rs` so Engrave keeps flutes, shank, and holder clear of protected faces and edges across cutting moves, plunges, retracts, and rapid links.\n- Kept baseline toolpaths identical when `AvoidSpec` is empty, refused blocked cuts by protected item name, and updated MCP tool descriptions in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs` and `docs/agents/mcp-tools.md`.\n- Addressed review findings: added `trace_avoid_rotates_closed_loop_seam_around_overhead_plunge_blocker` and `trace_avoid_trims_open_run_endpoints_under_overhead_clearance_blocker` in `crates/motion/tests/avoid_engrave.rs`, split `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/do_not_touch_engrave.rs` with 1200.0 harness height, added `crates/app/tests/do_not_touch_engrave.rs`, and added `docs/decisions/3349-engrave-do-not-touch.md`.\n- Merged `upstream/main` (`2de071415`), kept both `2D Adaptive` and `Engrave` in `avoid.rs`, `tools.rs`, `mcp-tools.md`, and `do_not_touch.rs`, and applied `9f983e720` removing duplicate closers in `avoid.rs`.\n\n## Verification\n\nVerified on head `9f983e720af68fbc63bd98e33f67748e078982ca` under `PROCESS_VERSION 140`:\n\n- `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-motion --lib --test avoid_engrave --test avoid_pocket`: `lib` 576 passed, 0 failed, 10 ignored; `avoid_engrave` 5 passed; `avoid_pocket` 3 passed.\n- `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-app --lib --test do_not_touch --test do_not_touch_engrave --test do_not_touch_face --test do_not_touch_finish3d --test do_not_touch_project --test engrave_law --test mcp --test mcp_doc_drift --test verify --test golden_cl --test example_catalog --test example_catalog_adaptive --test example_catalog_edge_work --test first_part_programs --test first_router_part --test first_4axis_part --test continuous_4axis_part --test tilt_basis_compat --test catalog_groove_part_off`: all 20 targets passed with 0 failed (`lib` 303, `do_not_touch` 5, `do_not_touch_engrave` 3, `do_not_touch_face` 3, `do_not_touch_finish3d` 5, `do_not_touch_project` 3, `engrave_law` 10, `mcp` 29, `mcp_doc_drift` 6, `verify` 21 with 2 ignored, `golden_cl` 34, `example_catalog` 39 with 4 ignored, `example_catalog_adaptive` 1, `example_catalog_edge_work` 1, `first_part_programs` 2, `first_router_part` 4, `first_4axis_part` 4, `continuous_4axis_part` 10, `tilt_basis_compat` 7, `catalog_groove_part_off` 1).\n- `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-ui --lib -- --test-threads=1`: 1523 passed, 0 failed, 8 ignored (including `do_not_touch::adaptive2d_shows_the_pick_protected_button_and_no_unsupported_note`, `do_not_touch::face_op_shows_pick_protected_button`, and `do_not_touch_engrave::engrave_boundaries_shows_do_not_touch_controls_and_takes_picks`).\n- `cargo clippy -j 10 -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed (exit 0).\n- `cargo xtask gate light` (`CAMCRAFT_GATE_JOBS=10`, `CAMCRAFT_NO_SCCACHE=1`): passed (3 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled; wall 5.0 min).\n- Trial merge against `upstream/main`: clean (`git merge-tree --write-tree` exit 0).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Interactive desktop click session (exercised through `egui_kittest`).\n\nfork synced at v0.25.0\nChangelog: Engrave operations now support Do not touch protection surfaces (UI, MCP, project roundtrip, and motion avoidance).\nEffort: high\n\nFixes #3349\n",
